  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/ExpoMadridVicentGarciaNebot1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 321px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El abogado urbanista ondense Vicent Garcia Nebot expone desde este martes, 13 de mayo, al d&iacute;a 27 sus vi&ntilde;etas humor&iacute;sticas de actualidad en el Espacio Ronda de Madrid, bajo el t&iacute;tulo La paella nacional, dentro de los actos del X aniversario de periodico <a href=\"http://www.elmundofinanciero.com/\" target=\"_blank\">elmundofinanciero.com</a>.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomadridlapaellanacionalzentejuakin/expomadridvicentgarcianebot1.jpg\" alt=\"expomadridvicentgarcianebot1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomadridlapaellanacionalzentejuakin/expomadridvicentgarcianebot2.jpg\" alt=\"expomadridvicentgarcianebot2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomadridlapaellanacionalzentejuakin/expomadridvicentgarcianebot3.jpg\" alt=\"expomadridvicentgarcianebot3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomadridlapaellanacionalzentejuakin/expomadridvicentgarcianebot4.jpg\" alt=\"expomadridvicentgarcianebot4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomadridlapaellanacionalzentejuakin/expomadridvicentgarcianebot5.jpg\" alt=\"expomadridvicentgarcianebot5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomadridlapaellanacionalzentejuakin/expomadridvicentgarcianebot6.jpg\" alt=\"expomadridvicentgarcianebot6\" style=\"max-w